---
id: sponsors
title: Sponsorship
description: "Sponsor KCD Your City 2099 on 15 May at the Your City Convention Centre. Gold, Silver and Bronze packages, audience figures and key dates."
---
{{ layout "layouts/page.vto" }}

{{# The packages, the attendee survey and the key dates come from `sponsorship`
    (src/_data/sponsorship.yaml), which tracks the prospectus; the words, the
    headline numbers, the contact address and the prospectus link are this
    page's. #}}

{{ set siteTitle = `${event.name} ${event.year}` }}
{{# The sponsors@ address (not the general one) and the prospectus, named in
    more than one place below. The size is shown next to every download link
    so nobody starts a large download unannounced on mobile data; update it
    when the PDF is replaced. The demo's prospectus is a one-page placeholder. #}}
{{ set email = "sponsors@example.com" }}
{{ set prospectus = "/assets/kcd-your-city-2099-sponsorship-prospectus.pdf" }}
{{ set prospectusSize = "PDF, 2 KB" }}
{{# "Four ways to support the event"; digits past ten. #}}
{{ set packageCount = ["No", "One", "Two", "Three", "Four", "Five", "Six", "Seven", "Eight", "Nine", "Ten"][sponsorship.packages.length] || sponsorship.packages.length }}

{{ set intro }}
    KCD Your City is a community-organized, not-for-profit event, and it
    would not happen without our partners. On
    <time datetime="{{ event.date.iso }}">{{ event.date.label }}</time>
    your brand can meet the people who build and run cloud native
    infrastructure in this region.
{{ /set }}

<!-- Intro -->
{{ comp ui.section { width: "4xl" } }}
    {{ comp ui.heading { level: 1, pill: "Sponsorship", title: `Sponsor ${siteTitle}`, lede: intro } }}
        {{ comp ui.actions }}
            {{ comp.ui.button({
                label: "Download the prospectus",
                href: prospectus,
                icon: "fa-file-pdf",
                style: "primary",
                note: `(${prospectusSize})`,
            }) }}
            {{ comp.ui.button({
                label: "Talk to us",
                href: `mailto:${email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(`${siteTitle} sponsorship`)}`,
                icon: "fa-envelope",
                style: "outline",
            }) }}
        {{ /comp }}
    {{ /comp }}
{{ /comp }}

<!-- Key numbers -->
{{# Headline figures from the prospectus. #}}
<section class="bg-white px-6 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-center md:grid-cols-4">
            <div>
                <dt class="sr-only">Attendees</dt>
                <dd>
                    <span class="block text-4xl font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">300</span>
                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500">Attendees</span>
                </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt class="sr-only">Speakers</dt>
                <dd>
                    <span class="block text-4xl font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">12</span>
                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500">Speakers</span>
                </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt class="sr-only">Tracks</dt>
                <dd>
                    <span class="block text-4xl font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">2</span>
                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500">Tracks</span>
                </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt class="sr-only">Individual ticket</dt>
                <dd>
                    <span class="block text-4xl font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">€99</span>
                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500">Individual ticket</span>
                </dd>
            </div>
        </dl>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Why sponsor -->
<section id="why" class="px-6 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center">
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
                Why sponsor
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
                Sponsoring a KCD puts your company in front of a technical
                audience that is hard to reach any other way.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-5 rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-lg">
                <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10">
                    {{ comp.ui.icon({ name: "fa-bullhorn", classes: "text-xl text-accent" }) }}
                </span>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-black">Brand awareness</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        Unparalleled visibility within the cloud native and Kubernetes
                        communities, connecting your company with highly engaged developers,
                        system engineers, architects and technical leaders.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-5 rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-lg">
                <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10">
                    {{ comp.ui.icon({ name: "fa-handshake", classes: "text-xl text-accent" }) }}
                </span>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-black">Networking</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        Access to quality, targeted attendees, and a powerful platform to
                        promote your product and recruit top talent from a diverse pool of
                        skilled professionals.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-5 rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-lg">
                <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10">
                    {{ comp.ui.icon({ name: "fa-seedling", classes: "text-xl text-accent" }) }}
                </span>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-black">Commitment to community</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        Associate your brand with one of the fastest-growing technology
                        communities and demonstrate your commitment to community growth and
                        development.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-5 rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-lg">
                <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10">
                    {{ comp.ui.icon({ name: "fa-award", classes: "text-xl text-accent" }) }}
                </span>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-black">Credibility</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        Establish your brand as a prominent and influential player in cloud
                        native technology.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Packages -->
<section id="packages" class="bg-white px-6 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center">
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
                Sponsorship packages
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
                {{ if sponsorship.packages.length }}
                    {{ packageCount }} ways to support the event. Every package is also open to
                    discussion, so tell us what you are trying to achieve.
                {{ else }}
                    The packages are being put together; tell us what you are trying
                    to achieve and we will shape one with you.
                {{ /if }}
            </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
            {{ for pkg of sponsorship.packages }}
                {{ comp.sponsorship.package({ pkg, href: `mailto:${email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(`${siteTitle} ${pkg.name} sponsorship`)}` }) }}
            {{ /for }}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Audience: while there are survey figures. -->
{{ if sponsorship.audience.roles.length || sponsorship.audience.facts.length }}
<section id="audience" class="px-6 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center">
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
                Who is in the room
            </h2>
            {{# Names the survey `sponsorship.audience` comes from; update the two together. #}}
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
                Figures from the Your City cloud native meetup's 2098 member survey.
            </p>
        </div>

        {{# Bars scaled against 100%, so the lengths read as shares of the audience. #}}
        <dl class="rounded-lg bg-white p-8 shadow-lg">
            <p class="mb-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500">
                Attendees describe themselves as
            </p>
            {{ for role of sponsorship.audience.roles }}
                <div class="mb-5 last:mb-0">
                    <div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
                        <dt class="font-medium text-black">{{ role.label }}</dt>
                        <dd class="shrink-0 font-semibold tabular-nums text-primary">{{ role.value }}%</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-100">
                        <div
                            class="h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"
                            style="width: {{ role.value }}%"
                        ></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{ /for }}
        </dl>

        <ul class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
            {{ for fact of sponsorship.audience.facts }}
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-lg">
                    {{ comp.ui.icon({ name: fact.icon, classes: "mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent" }) }}
                    <p class="text-gray-700 [&>strong]:font-semibold [&>strong]:text-black">{{ fact.text }}</p>
                </li>
            {{ /for }}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
{{ /if }}

<!-- Key dates: while there are any. -->
{{ if sponsorship.dates.length }}
<section id="dates" class="bg-white px-6 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-center text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
            Key dates
        </h2>
        {{# The deadline is the `highlight: true` entry in `sponsorship.dates`. #}}
        <p class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg text-gray-600">
            Sponsorship fees and logo assets are due two weeks before the event.
        </p>
        <dl class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
            {{ for entry of sponsorship.dates }}
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-200 px-6 py-4 last:border-b-0 {{ if entry.highlight }}bg-accent/10{{ /if }}">
                    <dt class="font-semibold {{ if entry.highlight }}text-accent{{ else }}text-black{{ /if }}">
                        {{ entry.label }}
                    </dt>
                    <dd class="shrink-0 text-gray-600">
                        <time datetime="{{ entry.date }}">{{ entry.date |> formatDate }}</time>
                    </dd>
                </div>
            {{ /for }}
        </dl>
    </div>
</section>
{{ /if }}

<!-- Contact -->
<section class="px-6 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
            Let's talk
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">
            Chloé Sample and Dev Fictional look after sponsorship. Email us and we
            will come back to you with the details, or take the full prospectus
            away and read it first.
        </p>
        {{ comp ui.actions }}
            {{ comp.ui.button({
                label: email,
                href: `mailto:${email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(`${siteTitle} sponsorship`)}`,
                icon: "fa-envelope",
                style: "primary",
            }) }}
            {{ comp.ui.button({
                label: "Download the prospectus",
                href: prospectus,
                icon: "fa-file-pdf",
                style: "outline",
                note: `(${prospectusSize})`,
            }) }}
        {{ /comp }}

        <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl rounded-lg border border-secondary bg-secondary/20 p-8 text-left">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                {{ comp.ui.icon({ name: "fa-people-group", classes: "mt-1 shrink-0 text-3xl text-accent" }) }}
                <div>
                    <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-black">
                        Community sponsors
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        We welcome community projects and influencers as
                        community sponsors too. The packages above are not the
                        only way in, so get in touch and we will find something
                        that works.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
